[[Image:Isk persuade.gif|right|Persuade]]
A successful '''persuade''' check prompts [[non-player character|NPCs]] to reveal additional information or give bonus treasure in conversation.
*'''Ability''': [[charisma]]

*'''Classes''': [[bard]], [[blackguard]], [[cleric]], [[druid]], [[Harper scout]], [[monk]], [[paladin]], [[pale master]], [[red dragon disciple]], [[rogue]], [[shadowdancer]], [[shifter]]

*'''[[Cross-class skill|Cross-class]]''': yes

*'''[[untrained skill check|Requires training]]''': no

*'''Check''': The [[difficulty class]] is determined by the NPC being spoken to.

*'''Use''': Used in conversation.
